title: '[RWF] pallet-nft-fractionalization: fractionalize accepts zero fractions'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Closes #12194

    ## Summary

    `fractionalize` accepted `fractions = 0`, which would place a deposit hold.

    This PR adds an early `ensure!(!fractions.is_zero(), Error::ZeroFractions)` check in `fractionalize`, before any holds, locks, or storage writes occur, plus a regression test (`fractionalize_with_zero_fractions_should_fail`) verifying the call is rejected and no `NftToAsset` entry / NFT lock results.
crates:
- name: pallet-nft-fractionalization
  bump: major
